CdM Student Portal — Frontend Environment Configuration
Copy this file to .env and fill in the values.
For Vercel: set these same keys in Project > Settings > Environment Variables
(all environments), then redeploy so Vite can bake them into the build.

# Backend API endpoint for announcements
# Local: http://localhost:8000/announcements
# Prod (example): https://your-api.onrender.com/announcements
VITE_ANNOUNCEMENTS_ENDPOINT=http://localhost:8000/announcements

# Backend API endpoint for submitting concerns
# Prod (example): https://your-api.onrender.com/submit-concern
VITE_SUBMIT_CONCERN_ENDPOINT=http://localhost:8000/submit-concern

# Backend API endpoint for admin dashboard
# Prod (example): https://your-api.onrender.com/admin
VITE_ADMIN_ENDPOINT=http://localhost:8000/admin

# Backend API endpoint for student auth/dashboard
# NOTE: src/lib/student-api.ts is currently missing — create it before using this.
# Prod (example): https://your-api.onrender.com/student
VITE_STUDENT_ENDPOINT=http://localhost:8000/student


